WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV v3.0 — gates (15s) Narrator George

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.451
First, a computer should not take an irreversible

2
00:00:03.451 --> 00:00:06.989
action until an independent check confirms it is safe.

3
00:00:07.349 --> 00:00:10.785
Second, it should try the cheapest method first and

4
00:00:10.785 --> 00:00:14.222
wake a large AI model only when simpler tools miss.

5
00:00:14.582 --> 00:00:19.419
Third, every decision is written to a receipt with the energy it used,

6
00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:21.422
so anyone can audit it later.
